Color scheme
------------

The interface and SQL syntax colors defined in src/ui/theme.rs are taken
from the dark theme of the IntelliJ Platform
(https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community), Copyright JetBrains s.r.o.
and contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Only color
values are used; DBeast contains no IntelliJ Platform source code, icons,
images or theme files.

